{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3492","id":4626306210,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz888AAAABE7_Uog","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3492","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3492.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3492.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3492","number":3492,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"mapper, state: send removed peers as their own delta","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tailscale clients only report removed peers to IPN bus watchers when they\r\napply a map response incrementally, and the Android app (since 1.100) relies\r\non that alone. Headscale worked removals out inside responses carrying\r\n`DNSConfig`, `SSHPolicy`, `Node` or `Peers` (a deletion merged into a policy\r\nrecompute, a policy change hiding peers, a full update, the initial map after\r\na reconnect), each forcing a full netmap rebuild, so the app kept showing the\r\npeer. Removals now lead in a `PeersRemoved`-only response and `DeleteNode`\r\nemits them as their own change; tailscale/tailscale#15660 fixes the client\r\nfrom 1.104, so the separate frames are marked compat and\r\n`capver.CanOldCodeBeCleanedUp` flags them once 1.104 is the minimum.\r\n\r\nPolicy responses also stop carrying `DNSConfig`, which forced a full rebuild\r\non every policy change; a node gets its DNS config with its own refresh when\r\nits NextDNS nodeAttrs, tags or hostname change.\r\n\r\nUpdates tailscale/tailscale#15660","created_at":"2026-09-24T13:13:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T17:03:14Z","closed_at":"2026-09-30T17:03:13Z","merged_at":"2026-09-30T17:03:13Z","merge_commit_sha":"eeaac680bef26585c8cc1569f949e26d0d6aba80","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/milestones/14","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/milestone/14","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/milestones/14/labels","id":13296439,"node_id":"MI_kwDOEFLz884AyuM3","number":14,"title":"v0.29","description":"Grants, SSH check mode, PingRequest","creato